         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Introduction\n\nWe know a ruler can measure objects. Now let's learn how to use it.\n\nIn this class we take the first steps: measuring length in one direction.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "4ef7ea19-2c9d-4b04-8e9b-6973ddf0876b",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "4ef7ea19-2c9d-4b04-8e9b-6973ddf0876b",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "happy",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "e609a3e8-7a6b-4d38-b74c-3cece49c66d1",
               "text": "Original Text",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=e609a3e8-7a6b-4d38-b74c-3cece49c66d1",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Step by Step\n\nTo measure an object with a ruler, follow these steps:\n\n- Lay it along the ruler's edge, with one end at the 0 mark.\n- Keep it straight, without tilting. Look at the mark under the other end.\n- That number is the measure: the object's length in the direction you chose.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "104de17e-0acb-4a22-8f10-1b42b01b6bab",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "104de17e-0acb-4a22-8f10-1b42b01b6bab",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "inlove",
         "source_menu": [
