         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Conclusion\n\nWe learned to measure with a ruler and to check whether objects share the same length.\n\nSame length is only the first step: with the three strings, two objects are fully equal only when they match in every characteristic we compare — length and color together.",
               "source": null,
